{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>But he who pronounces the Name of HaShem shall surely be put to death.</b> But one who pronounces the Name of HaShem — his punishment is not like the punishment for cursing other deities, nor does that punishment apply to him even with the inclusive plural, but rather it is death." "<b>As the sojourner, so the native.</b> And this punishment does not apply to one who blasphemes now because he is a sojourner, for in this matter the native too was equal to him in pronouncing the Name."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:43.065313502Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}